===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|whit}}, {{m|enm|hwit}}, from {{inh|en|ang|hwīt}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*hwīt}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*hwītaz}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*ḱweydós}}, a byform of {{m|ine-pro|*ḱweytós|t=bright; shine}}. 

See also {{cog|fy|wyt}}, {{cog|nl|wit}}, {{cog|de|weiß}}, {{cog|nb|hvit}}, {{cog|nn|kvit}}; also {{cog|lt|šviẽsti|t=to gleam}}, {{m|lt|šviesa|t=light}}, {{cog|cu|свѣтъ|t=light}}, {{m|cu|свѣтьлъ|t=clear, bright}}, {{cog|fa|سفید|tr=sefid}}, {{cog|ae|𐬯𐬞𐬀𐬉𐬙𐬀|tr=spaēta|t=white}}, {{cog|sa|श्वेत|t=white, bright|tr=śvetá}}.

