# {{lb|en|chiefly|historical}} Designated for use by Caucasians.
#: {{ux|en|'''white''' drinking fountain}}
#: {{ux|en|'''white''' hospital}}
# Relatively [[light]] or [[pale]] in [[colour]].<!--but e.g. white grapes are green-->
#: {{ux|en|'''white''' wine}}
#: {{ux|en|'''white''' grapes}}
#: {{ux|en|'''white''' birch}}
# Pale or [[pallid]], as from fear, illness, etc.
